{"kind":"stack","id":"nutrition-stack","title":"Animals and nutrition: what living things eat","theme":{"background":"#fdf8ec","foreground":"#1f2a1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c1-p","picto":"apple"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"Can animals make their own food like plants do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Yes, they make food in their bodies","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"No, they must get food from what they eat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Only animals that live in water","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Nutrition"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"The food and drink a living thing needs to grow, move and stay healthy."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c3-p","picto":"cow"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Where does a cow get its nutrition from?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"From the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"From grass and plants it eats","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"From the soil it stands on","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-d","label":"From the water in rivers","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which of these is a food that gives a child the nutrition they need?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"A bowl of vegetable soup with bread","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Only sweets all day","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Air, because we breathe it","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c5-p","picto":"bird"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"A robin is hungry on a cold morning. Which path should it take?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Search the garden for worms and seeds","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Wait by the window for a snack","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The robin finds worms and seeds. It eats well and has the energy to sing."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"No food comes, and the robin grows weak. It must search harder tomorrow."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Digestion"},{"type":"text","id":"c8-e","content":"The way an animal's body breaks down food so its nutrients can be used."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c9-p","picto":"heart"},{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Why do humans need a mix of different foods?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"So the body gets all the nutrition it needs to stay healthy","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"So the body can make its own vitamins from sunlight alone","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"So food tastes better with more colours","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"Well done! You finished the nutrition quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"Animals, including people, must eat the right food and the right amount to grow strong and healthy."}],"actions":[]}}
